        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I had a bit of trouble getting this to work within my `combine_groups` fn. [Here's my current setup](https://github.com/pablopunk/dotfiles/blob/2db924ce73726af11d3760d68b0f0c8a95f306c9/nvim/.config/nvim/lua/plugins/mini.lua#L76-L88) in case anyone's interested, using this custom function:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nfunction create_statusline_separator(before_hl, after_hl, char)\r\n  local hl_name = string.format(\"Statusline%s%s\", before_hl, after_hl)\r\n  vim.cmd(\r\n    string.format(\r\n      [[ hi! %s guifg=%s guibg=%s ]],\r\n      hl_name,\r\n      string.format(\"#%06x\", vim.api.nvim_get_hl_by_name(before_hl, true).background),\r\n      string.format(\"#%06x\", vim.api.nvim_get_hl_by_name(after_hl, true).background)\r\n    )\r\n  )\r\n  return \"%#\" .. hl_name .. \"#\" .. char\r\nend\r\n```\r\n\r\n<img width=\"900\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/4324982/cc7d6e15-a479-4b27-91c0-4e823c735cdb\">\r\n\r\nIf this can be done easier or better, please ping me!",
