        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> If this can be done easier or better, please ping me!\r\n\r\nGenerally, this looks fine. However, it should be noted that this function (`config.content.active` and hence `utils.create_statusline_separator()`) will be called **very** frequently. So I'd some precomputation instead of two `nvim_get_hl_by_name` calls per `create_statusline_separator` (which is 6 calls per statusline redraw). Furthermore, I'd use this function only if either of `before_hl` or `after_hl is not known in advance, which is only for the first call.",
